{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elevate Your Career</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the world as you build your career in the skies. Explore exotic destinations and work aboard a variety of aircraft, each with its own unique characteristics and features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335780/extras/a67964a760b40ad50fb552bcb90f98d4.poster.avif?t=1755660355\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335780/extras/a67964a760b40ad50fb552bcb90f98d4.webm?t=1755660355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335780/extras/a67964a760b40ad50fb552bcb90f98d4.mp4?t=1755660355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Safety Above All</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure the safety and comfort of your passengers by delivering exceptional in-flight service and managing critical emergencies, including mechanical failures, cabin decompressions, and on-board fires. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335780/extras/579c6d412d46a88a96cf4aa7d20ee36a.avif?t=1755660355\" width=616 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rest in Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover distinctive hotels during your layovers, where the quality of your accommodations reflects your career performance and achievements.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335780/extras/ef692fb466f4f3ac1abe0a0a80750245.poster.a